This source context is a thin deployment binding around the official stable
SGLang v0.5.20 CUDA 13 multi-architecture image (linux/arm64 child) at source
commit 94602c9c2b7cbdb8efd5c52802dac6a1c180089e (Apache-2.0).

The model/API flags follow SGLang's official Inkling day-zero tracker. The
GB10 execution flags are adapted from SGLang's physically verified two-Spark
Inkling-Small profile (docs/src/snippets/configs/thinkingmachines/inkling-small.jsx
at the same v0.5.20 commit): Triton attention, Marlin FP4/MoE, disabled prefill
CUDA graphs, and the extra-buffer Mamba radix-cache strategy. The flagship TP8
topology is source-complete but remains Pending until an eight-Spark physical
canary succeeds.
